    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎞️ PARSE & FILTER VIDEO FILES\nThis section:\n• Detects missing or invalid folder paths\n• Splits the raw file list\n• Filters by video extensions (.mp4, .mov, .mkv, .avi, ...)\n• Generates: fileName + filePath\n• Handles the \"NO VIDEOS\" scenario\n",
        "height": 432,
